				<guid>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fck-2/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Zeus, Isis, and the rest of Earth&amp;rsquo;s mythological gods have a destructive plan to regain humanity&amp;rsquo;s worship. Will it work? Not if Jesus, Satan, and a nun named Maria have anything to say about it! (That is, if Jesus and Satan can keep their hormones under control long enough to mount an attack.)Back-up Features:Holy F&lt;em&gt;ck Origins: 994 ADHoly F&lt;/em&gt;ck Origins: 1958 ADRelease Dates:Digital Edition - 12/10/2014Print Edition - 03/04/2015&lt;/p&gt;</description>
