			<item>
				<title>Holy F*ck #3</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fck-3/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fck-3/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Jesus takes the fight directly to Zeus and Isis, the two mythological gods leading a horde of desperate, worship-hungry deities! But do Jesus, Satan, and Sister Maria actually stand a chance? And can they keep their sh&lt;em&gt;t together long enough to stop the coming madness? Note: This comic book was not actually funded via Kickstarter, nonetheless this issue is associated with the concept as Isis and Zeus are trying to fund and &amp;quot;kickstart&amp;quot; the apocalypse.Back-up Feature:Holy F&lt;/em&gt;ck Origins: 1532 ADList of covers and their creators:CoverNameCreator(s)Sidebar LocationRegRegular CoverDaniel Arruda Massa1VarVariant CoverKaylie McDougal2VarVariant CoverKaylie McDougal3Release Dates:Digital Edition - 2/4/2015Print Edition - 3/11/2015&lt;/p&gt;</description>
