			<item>
				<title>Holy F*cked #1</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-1/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-1/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;After recklessly killing tons of gods in HOLY F*CK, Jesus is back, again, and chilling with Satan in domestic bliss. And their best bud, Sister Maria, is managing a local homeless shelter. Sounds great, right? Not for Hercules! The &amp;quot;Muscles from Mt. Olympus&amp;quot; is pissed and he wants revenge. Plus&amp;hellip; what shocking news does Satan have for his macho messiah? The all new first issue from the sequel to the popular series comes with a limited to 1,500 copies Halloween themed variant cover.List of covers and their creators:CoverNameCreator(s)Sidebar LocationRegRegular CoverDaniel Arruda Massa1VarVariant Cover (Halloween), Limited to 1500Daniel Arruda Massa2VarSan Diego Comic-Con Exclusive Variant Cover, Limited to 100Daniel Arruda Massa3&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Holy F*cked #2</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-2/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-2/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;We&amp;rsquo;re serving up a piping hot pile of excitement as a mild-mannered dinner party turns deadly! Jesus and Satan are hosting Maria and her new lover, Thanatos, over for an evening of camaraderie and conversation. But Thanatos isn&amp;rsquo;t actually Thanatos&amp;hellip; he&amp;rsquo;s Hercules! And he wants to kill Jesus. Plus&amp;hellip; introducing the righteous might of The New Apostles!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Holy F*cked #3</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-3/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-3/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Hercules is driving a van full of explosives with Jesus tied up in the back. But he&amp;rsquo;s in for one hell of a ride because the New Apostles are out to stop him! Will Cosmic Moses, the Secret Pope, Mother 2resa, and the Holy Spirit halt Herc before he blows Jesus to kingdom come? Plus&amp;hellip; can Maria get Satan to the hospital on time?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Holy F*cked #4</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-4/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/comics/holy-fcked-4/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;BECAUSE YOU DEMANDED IT: a legendary Greek demigod battles a pissed off Argentinian nun! (Okay, maybe you didn&amp;rsquo;t actually demand it&amp;hellip;). Maria fights her former lover as the fate of Jesus hangs in the balance. Can she dispatch Hercules as easily as his daddy, Zeus? Plus&amp;ndash;what surprise does Satan have waiting at the hospital?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
